OL,3,GNEWSAThe moorland search for a missing
OL,4,Aairman who died in 1944
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn an autumn day 82 years ago, a crew
OL,7,Fof American airmen set off for what was
OL,8,Fsupposed to be a routine test flight.
OL,10,FInstead, their B24H bomber crashed on
OL,11,FTwizle Head Moor near Holmfirth in West
OL,12,FYorkshire, killing nine United States
OL,13,FAir Force (USAF) personnel. There was
OL,14,Fone survivor.
OL,16,FThe bodies of eight of the crew were
OL,17,Frecovered from the remote crash site at
OL,18,Fthe time, but the remains of Cpl
OL,19,FClarence Watson, 22, were never found.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
